<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan Agriculture details harvest progress.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan Agriculture details harvest progress.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Agriculture on Tuesday detailed the level of harvest progress to Sept 23.</p>
<p>CROP	    SWATHED (PCT)  COMBINED (PCT)</p>
<p>		 1996 91/95  Avg 1996 91/95 Avg</p>
<p>w.wheat	  1    6	   98    93</p>
<p>s.wheat	 38   28	   49    59</p>
<p>durum	   24   22	   56    60</p>
<p>oats	    44   32	   41    55</p>
<p>barley	  32   26	   61    67</p>
<p>fall rye	 0    3	  100    97</p>
<p>spring rye     6   25	   94    70</p>
<p>flax	    29   24	    6    26</p>
<p>canola	  42   36	   56    61</p>
<p>mustard	 21   21	   69    67</p>
<p>sunflowers     0    1	    0     7</p>
<p>lentils	 11   14	   80    74</p>
<p>peas	    10   14	   80    66</p>
<p>canary seed   23   16	   10    41</p>
<p>total:	  34   28	   52    60</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
